{"id":"aviso","lemma":"aviso","pos":"noun","rank":1633,"glosses":["warning","announcement","notice"],"ipa":"/aˈbiso/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"avisos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-aviso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es la última vez que te aviso.","en":"I'm warning you for the last time.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"final","l":"último"},{"g":"time, instance"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"La tienda está cerrada hasta próximo aviso.","en":"The store is closed until further notice.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"tent"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"shut, closed","l":"cerrado"},{"g":"until"},{"g":"near"},null]},{"text":"Déjame pensarlo y te aviso después.","en":"Let me think it over, and I'll let you know later.","words":[{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"later"}]},{"text":"Tom envió un aviso a Mary.","en":"Tom paged Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302124","words":[null,{"g":"to send","l":"enviar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Tom fue despedido sin previo aviso.","en":"Tom was dismissed without notice.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806059","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"laid off, dismissed"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"previous"},null]}]}